'' PASCAL REVERSES ITS PARAMETERS -- the definition, and every call that knows the
'' callee is pascal, named or through a pascal procedure TYPE. See PascalParamOrder in
'' codegen/abi.bas. The two pointer calls: through the pascal type the literal 3 goes
'' first, through the cdecl one last.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: --emit-ir tests/codegen/src/pascal-order.bas
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-OUT: define i32 @"_ZN1T1MEii"(i32 %p2, i32 %p1, ptr %p0)
'' EXPECT-OUT: define void @"RB"(ptr sret([32 x i8]) align 8 %p0, i32 %p2, i32 %p1)
'' EXPECT-OUT: define double @"P"(i64 %p2, double %p1, i32 %p0)
'' EXPECT-OUT: (i64 3, double
'' EXPECT-OUT: , i64 3)
